The '''Abyssal Area''' can be accessed by using the code {{Fairycode|ALR}} in the [[fairy rings]] network (must have started [[Fairytale II - Cure a Queen]]). It is one of several areas in [[Abyssal Space]], and as such is inhabited by the Abyss' denizens. [[Abyssal demon]]s can also be found in this section of the Abyss; however, the demons here are rarely killed unless part of [[Konar quo Maten]]'s Slayer assignment due to them being spread out and the other monsters being aggressive.

Since the Abyssal Area is the whole plane itself, players assigned abyssal demons in the Abyss may alternatively kill the [[Abyssal Sire]].

Unlike the [[Abyss]], it is not a [[multi-combat area]]. There is only one fairy ring in the south-east corner of the cavern, and the only other exit is via teleport. When entering you are neither [[skulled]] nor drained of [[prayer]], as the fairy ring teleports players here, not the [[Mage of Zamorak]]. It may be safer to obtain [[essence pouch]]es here as you will not need to cross the [[Wilderness]] first and risk your gear, nor will you have multiple monsters fighting you at once.

A [[dwarf multicannon]] '''cannot''' be used in the Abyssal Area. The [[abyssal leech]]es, [[abyssal walker|walkers]], and [[abyssal guardian|guardians]] provide 75% less experience when fought. This experience reduction does not apply to the abyssal demons.

