The '''Witchaven Dungeon''' is a [[List of dungeons|dungeon]] located below the [[Pillars of Zanash]] near [[Witchaven]]. It can be accessed via the [[old ruin entrance]]. The dungeon is used in a number of quests and is the home to a number of monsters, so it may be advisable to bring [[food]] if you are a lower level player.

The entire dungeon is single way combat and the dwarf multi-cannon is usable here.

==Transportation==
* [[Ardougne Teleport]] or the [[Ardougne teleport|tablet]] then head east.
* [[Fairy rings|Fairy ring]] code {{Fairycode|blr}} and head south. 

==Layout==
===Main section===
When you enter the dungeon, you will come into a room containing aggressive level 28 [[hobgoblin]]s. To the north lies a section which leads into 3 rooms. The north and south rooms contain level 53 [[ogre]]s. The east room contains a few [[hellhound]]s, which you are able to cannon. This section of the dungeon is a key part in the [[Family Crest]] [[quest]] for obtaining [['perfect' gold ore]].

{{LocationMonsterTableHead}}
{{LocationMonsterTableLine|name=Hellhound|levels=122|spawns=8}}
