====The puzzle====
To enter the section of the dungeon containing the [[Hellhound|hellhounds]], you will first have to solve a lever puzzle. The following is a set of instructions on how to gain access to the room with the hellhounds.

(If you log out at any point before completing the puzzle, you will have to start over.)

# Head to the lever located '''outside''' the northern room and pull it up.
# Head to the southernmost lever, located '''inside''' the southern room, and pull it up.
## You will need to enter through the east door and exit through the west door.
# Return to the lever '''outside''' the northern room and pull it down.
# Enter the northern room and push the lever '''inside''' up.
# Return to the lever '''outside''' the northern room and pull it up.
# Go back to the southern room and pull the '''inside''' lever down.
## You will need to enter through the west door and exit through the east door.
# Now you are free to enter the room with the hellhounds.

Note: You only have to do the puzzle once to gain access to the hellhounds. If you leave and come back much later you can simply walk into the room via the door and it will not be locked.

===Secret section===
The secret section is discovered during [[The Slug Menace]]. This part of the dungeon is filled with level 45 [[giant lobster]]s. Players fight a level 62 [[Slug Prince]] later in the quest near the end of the hall. There is also an [[Agility]] [[shortcut]], which makes passage through the dungeon much quicker. Finally, at the very end of the dungeon is [[Mother Mallum]]'s lair, where she was imprisoned by the [[Temple Knights]] years ago.

